              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "NB:- Please note we reserve the right to alter the above itinerary if required for operational\nreasons. Given the historic nature of the places visited, a certain degree of walking will"
          }
        }
      ]
