            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EInsurance \u00A336\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ESingle room supplement \u00A3179\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EEntrance fees to places visited as part of this itinerary\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EGratuities\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ELocal accommodation tax to be paid directly to the hotel (approximately \u20AC1 per person per night)\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EPrice based on twin share. Minimum numbers\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
